Definitions.
- In this Order unless the context otherwise requires;
(a)
"Act"means the Essential Commodities Act, 1955 (
10 of 1955
);
(b)
"Producer" means any person who manufactures staple fibre;
(c)
"Textile Commissioner" means the Textile Commissioner to the Government of India, and includes any officer authorized
by him to exercise all or any of the powers of the Textile Commissioner under this Order.
